cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or build on the memory-native method, please cite it as below."
title: "memory-native: Training Without Master Weights — a 6-bit Finite-State Synapse with Optimizer-in-State"
abstract: >-
  A research implementation of finite-state counter synapses and reversible activations.
  Each packed coefficient code uses six bits for a visible ternary value and a bounded
  update accumulator. Scales, RMS statistics, floating-point model components and working
  memory are additional. Selected CPU and CUDA witnesses explore memory and quality
  trade-offs. A historical 1.21B-coefficient T4 fit report lacks its primary raw log;
  converged quality parity at scale remains open.
